From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SableOS <noreply@sableos.invalid>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 06:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] SableOS: lock screen Peek as an app column beside the newest
 notification

The Peek is laid out as BB10 shows it (owner pick from the JL10 review):
a column of app icons, each over its count, with a line beside the
column marked in the accent at the app with the newest notification, and
that notification on the right: the app and time, then its sender when
the lock screen shows all content and the notification needs no
redaction, else "N notifications". Never the message text. The newest
app always has a place in the column (SableLockGlance.Peek.newest).
